WEBVTT

02:41.744 --> 02:43.913
It's nice to meet you, right?

02:45.373 --> 02:48.251
Muzan Kibutsuji.

02:49.836 --> 02:56.467
What a hideous look you have, Ubuyashiki.

02:57.760 --> 03:02.932
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA:
HASHIRA TRAINING ARC

03:06.603 --> 03:10.982
THE LAST EPISODE:
HASHIRAS, ASSEMBLE

03:17.488 --> 03:22.076
Finally you have come to me.

03:23.286 --> 03:26.831
And now you are standing before me,

03:27.999 --> 03:30.668
Muzan Kibutsuji.

03:32.378 --> 03:36.382
The demon that my family,
the Demon Slayer Corps,

03:37.842 --> 03:43.097
has been pursuing for a thousand years.

03:44.807 --> 03:46.017
Amane,

03:46.643 --> 03:52.357
what does he look like?

03:54.067 --> 03:57.904
He appears to be a man
in his mid to late twenties.

03:59.781 --> 04:02.408
However, his eyes are a deep plum color,

04:03.660 --> 04:07.080
and his pupils are elongated like a cat's.

04:09.791 --> 04:10.875
Is that so?

04:11.626 --> 04:17.507
Right, I knew you would come.

04:18.383 --> 04:25.181
Because I was certain
you must be terribly angry at me,

04:25.848 --> 04:28.851
at the Ubuyashiki family.

04:30.061 --> 04:33.773
I knew you would come

04:33.856 --> 04:37.902
to kill me personally.

04:40.029 --> 04:44.325
I'm utterly disappointed, Ubuyashiki.

04:45.410 --> 04:47.328
Without knowing its place,

04:48.037 --> 04:53.876
the head of a family that has
interfered with me for a thousand years

04:53.960 --> 04:55.878
is now in such a pitiful state.

04:57.088 --> 05:00.591
Disgraceful. Absolutely disgraceful.

05:01.676 --> 05:06.431
You already reek of death, Ubuyashiki.

05:11.811 --> 05:13.313
I suppose you are right.

05:14.230 --> 05:17.775
Half a year ago, a doctor told me

05:18.776 --> 05:22.780
that I would die within a few days.

05:31.247 --> 05:35.460
And yet, I am still alive.

05:37.211 --> 05:42.425
Even that doctor was at a loss for words.

05:44.510 --> 05:46.137
It is purely

05:47.346 --> 05:51.517
because of my unwavering determination
to defeat you,

05:52.602 --> 05:53.770
Muzan.

05:55.271 --> 05:58.483
That fleeting dream of yours ends tonight.

05:59.233 --> 06:01.778
I'm going to kill you now.

06:04.822 --> 06:09.077
You might not know this,

06:10.703 --> 06:15.124
but you and I share the same bloodline.

06:17.835 --> 06:23.674
However, since you were born
over a thousand years ago,

06:25.384 --> 06:29.972
we are no longer closely related.

06:33.226 --> 06:35.770
I feel nothing after hearing that.

06:36.395 --> 06:38.606
What are you trying to say?

06:40.775 --> 06:47.031
Because the family gave birth
to a monster like you,

06:48.491 --> 06:53.121
my family was cursed.

06:57.625 --> 07:00.128
Every child born into my family

07:01.254 --> 07:04.924
was frail and died young.

07:07.009 --> 07:09.679
When my family
was on the brink of extinction,

07:10.888 --> 07:14.058
we received advice from a priest.

07:15.893 --> 07:19.063
He said that our bloodline
had given birth to a demon.

07:21.023 --> 07:26.112
He advised us to dedicate ourselves
to defeating that being.

07:27.447 --> 07:30.908
If we did so, our family would survive.

07:32.952 --> 07:37.206
For generations, we began
to take wives from families of priests,

07:38.583 --> 07:41.752
and our children
became less likely to die early.

07:42.670 --> 07:49.385
But even so, no one in my family
has lived beyond 30 years.

07:51.762 --> 07:54.682
Your nonsense has reached its peak.

07:55.433 --> 07:56.976
It makes me want to vomit.

07:57.602 --> 08:01.272
Has your illness spread to your brain?

08:02.023 --> 08:05.359
There's no connection
between those events.

08:06.611 --> 08:07.987
You know what?

08:08.738 --> 08:12.116
I haven't faced any divine retribution.

08:13.159 --> 08:18.623
Despite killing hundreds,
even thousands of people, I am forgiven.

08:19.457 --> 08:24.212
Over these thousand years,
I have never seen any God or Buddha.

08:26.881 --> 08:31.886
Is that how you perceive things?

08:34.847 --> 08:40.561
But I have my own way of thinking.

08:42.522 --> 08:46.484
Muzan, what is your dream?

08:49.070 --> 08:50.780
For the last thousand years,

08:51.781 --> 08:56.827
what kind of dreams
have you been dreaming?

08:59.330 --> 09:01.207
It's a strange feeling.

09:02.124 --> 09:03.626
Even with the very source

09:03.709 --> 09:06.754
of the Demon Slayer Corps' nuisance
right before me,

09:06.837 --> 09:08.506
I don't feel hatred.

09:09.465 --> 09:10.466
On the contrary…

09:13.386 --> 09:18.599
One after one

09:18.683 --> 09:23.813
Night has passed

09:23.896 --> 09:28.818
It will become lively

09:28.901 --> 09:34.198
So lively

09:34.282 --> 09:39.579
Put up some decorations

09:39.662 --> 09:45.042
Pine decorations

09:45.126 --> 09:49.922
Pine decorations

09:50.006 --> 09:55.553
Two

09:55.636 --> 10:00.766
The pine with two leaves

10:00.850 --> 10:03.728
It is colorful, so colorful

10:03.811 --> 10:08.691
This strange sense of nostalgia
and feeling of relief,

10:08.774 --> 10:10.818
it's disgusting.

10:12.361 --> 10:16.490
There are only four people
in this mansion.

10:17.325 --> 10:20.828
Ubuyashiki, his wife and his two children.

10:22.163 --> 10:24.248
No guards, nothing.

10:26.959 --> 10:29.337
Shall I guess, Muzan?

10:32.173 --> 10:36.677
I know what is on your mind.

10:38.971 --> 10:42.224
You are dreaming of eternity.

10:44.435 --> 10:48.022
You are dreaming of immortality.

10:50.232 --> 10:51.651
That's right.

10:52.735 --> 10:58.324
And that dream will soon come true,
once I acquire Nezuko.

11:00.076 --> 11:03.704
Your dream will not come true, Muzan.

11:04.580 --> 11:08.834
You seem quite confident
about hiding Nezuko.

11:09.919 --> 11:15.883
However, unlike you,
I have all the time in the world.

11:17.176 --> 11:20.888
You are mistaken.

11:23.140 --> 11:24.600
What?

11:26.644 --> 11:31.899
I know what eternity truly is.

11:34.944 --> 11:39.865
Eternity is the feelings of people.

11:43.744 --> 11:47.206
It is the feelings of people
that are eternal

11:48.916 --> 11:50.167
and immortal.

11:52.378 --> 11:53.587
Ridiculous.

11:54.255 --> 11:56.924
I'm sick of your nonsense.

11:58.801 --> 12:00.261
For a thousand years,

12:02.304 --> 12:04.849
the Demon Slayer Corps
has not disappeared.

12:06.434 --> 12:09.562
Countless unfortunate children have died,

12:11.021 --> 12:13.774
but they have never ceased to exist.

12:15.693 --> 12:17.403
That fact alone proves that

12:18.612 --> 12:21.615
the feelings of people,

12:21.699 --> 12:27.246
which you call ridiculous, are immortal.

12:35.713 --> 12:39.091
The feeling of not forgiving those

12:40.718 --> 12:46.015
who have taken the lives
of loved ones unjustly

12:51.061 --> 12:52.521
is eternal.

12:55.065 --> 12:59.653
No one has ever forgiven you.

13:02.490 --> 13:06.202
Not even once in these thousand years.

13:10.789 --> 13:13.667
Let me tell you, Muzan.

13:16.795 --> 13:20.925
You have stepped on the tiger's tail

13:22.051 --> 13:24.887
and provoked the dragon's wrath
countless times.

13:26.889 --> 13:31.310
You awakened them that should

13:32.102 --> 13:36.649
have remained dormant.

13:38.359 --> 13:43.531
They are always watching you,

13:45.115 --> 13:47.743
and determined never to let you escape.

13:51.330 --> 13:53.332
Even if you kill me,

13:54.458 --> 13:57.002
the Demon Slayer Corps
will remain unfazed.

13:59.046 --> 14:03.217
I myself am not that important.

14:05.177 --> 14:09.181
You can never understand

14:10.641 --> 14:14.353
the feelings and the bonds of people,

14:16.188 --> 14:17.314
Muzan.

14:19.108 --> 14:20.776
Because you…

14:22.444 --> 14:23.654
All of you demons…

14:25.197 --> 14:30.327
If you die, all the demons will perish,
won't they?

14:35.207 --> 14:36.917
The air just wavered.

14:39.295 --> 14:40.421
Did I hit the mark?

14:42.172 --> 14:43.257
Shut up.

14:44.758 --> 14:47.386
Okay, very well.

14:48.804 --> 14:51.849
I have said what I wanted
to say to you for so long.

14:53.642 --> 14:57.229
But may I say one last thing?

14:59.857 --> 15:04.778
Although I said I am not that important,

15:07.114 --> 15:10.534
my death will not be meaningless.

15:12.912 --> 15:16.999
I am fortunate to be respected
by the Demon Slayer Corps,

15:18.125 --> 15:23.130
especially the Hashiras,
who are fond of me.

15:25.174 --> 15:28.469
In other words, my death will only bolster

15:29.553 --> 15:33.641
their morale even more than before.

15:39.480 --> 15:41.482
Are you done talking?

15:42.816 --> 15:43.859
Yes.

15:44.860 --> 15:49.823
To be honest, I never expected you
to listen this long.

15:51.951 --> 15:54.828
Thank you, Muzan.

15:59.166 --> 16:02.086
Emergency summons!

16:02.169 --> 16:05.714
An attack on the Ubuyashiki residence!

16:05.798 --> 16:07.216
Master!

16:10.427 --> 16:12.554
Must go faster! I have to hurry!

16:15.099 --> 16:16.433
Master!

16:28.988 --> 16:30.406
Please make it in time!

16:44.378 --> 16:48.799
We should assign at least two Hashiras
to guard the Master.

16:49.591 --> 16:52.636
Can't you do anything about that,
Himejima?

16:54.471 --> 16:55.639
It is impossible.

16:56.515 --> 17:01.311
Since I became a Hashira at 19,
I have been asking that for eight years,

17:02.146 --> 17:04.023
but he refuses to listen.

17:05.816 --> 17:08.777
He insists that the Hashiras
are too precious

17:08.861 --> 17:13.157
and should not be used for
his personal protection alone.

17:14.908 --> 17:16.493
It is quite troubling.

17:18.328 --> 17:25.169
I heard that none of the heads of the
Ubuyashiki family have ever had guards.

17:31.759 --> 17:32.926
Master!

17:33.010 --> 17:34.303
Master!

17:34.386 --> 17:35.596
Master!

17:35.679 --> 17:36.722
Master!

17:36.805 --> 17:37.848
Master!

17:37.931 --> 17:38.891
Master!

17:41.769 --> 17:42.936
Almost there!

17:44.229 --> 17:45.564
It's the mansion!

17:45.647 --> 17:47.691
It's all right! I'll make it in time!

17:47.775 --> 17:48.776
I'll make…

19:10.482 --> 19:11.525
Explosives!

19:11.608 --> 19:15.612
And the overwhelming stench
of burning blood and flesh!

19:44.391 --> 19:48.228
Ubuyashiki!

19:49.688 --> 19:51.982
The look on his face!

19:52.900 --> 19:56.361
Even with a serene, Buddha-like smile,

19:56.445 --> 20:01.158
he blew himself, along with his wife
and children, to pieces with explosives.

20:03.076 --> 20:05.954
I was mistaken.

20:07.039 --> 20:13.212
I evaluated that man, Ubuyashiki,
to be an ordinary human,

20:14.254 --> 20:18.258
but I completely underestimated him.

20:20.302 --> 20:26.058
I expected some kind of trap,
but not to this extent.

20:27.768 --> 20:32.397
The explosives were filled
with tiny caltrops

20:32.481 --> 20:35.150
to increase their lethality.

20:36.902 --> 20:40.906
They were designed to delay
my regeneration as much as possible.

20:41.823 --> 20:44.534
Which means, there's more to come.

20:44.618 --> 20:48.080
Ubuyashiki must have another plan
in motion after this.

20:48.997 --> 20:51.583
I sense people gathering here.

20:51.667 --> 20:53.543
Probably the Hashiras.

20:53.627 --> 20:56.797
But not them, it's something else.

20:57.547 --> 21:02.302
That cunning man used himself as bait.

21:03.387 --> 21:07.182
His rage and hatred toward me
coiled darkly

21:07.266 --> 21:11.019
in his heart like a serpent.

21:12.104 --> 21:18.610
Hiding such murderous intent so well
at such a young age is astonishing.

21:19.444 --> 21:22.990
Were his wife and children
aware of this plan?

21:23.865 --> 21:27.452
No, I must not think about that now.

21:27.536 --> 21:31.581
Stay calm. My body will soon regenerate.

21:42.384 --> 21:44.219
Seeds of flesh?

21:44.303 --> 21:46.054
A Blood Demon Art!

21:56.231 --> 21:58.191
I got caught.

21:58.275 --> 22:01.194
Whose Blood Demon Art is this?

22:01.278 --> 22:05.324
The thorns branched out within my flesh
and it's hard to remove.

22:06.783 --> 22:08.660
No problem.

22:08.744 --> 22:10.704
There aren't that many.

22:10.787 --> 22:13.707
I just need to absorb them.

22:25.135 --> 22:28.513
Tamayo? Why are you here?

22:28.597 --> 22:31.475
This Blood Demon Art of thorns

22:31.558 --> 22:35.103
belongs to the person
you turned into a demon in Asakusa.

22:36.605 --> 22:40.067
She approached me using
a Demon Blood Art of concealment.

22:40.150 --> 22:42.694
What is her goal? What has she done?

22:43.653 --> 22:45.906
Why is this woman here?

22:49.117 --> 22:54.372
So you absorbed my fist, Muzan.

22:55.499 --> 22:59.086
What do you think was inside my fist?

23:00.337 --> 23:03.256
It's a medicine to turn demons
back into humans.

23:03.965 --> 23:06.968
How is it? Do you feel it taking effect?

23:07.844 --> 23:10.680
No way such medicine exists!

23:11.348 --> 23:13.350
I completed it.

23:13.433 --> 23:16.394
The situation has greatly changed.

23:16.478 --> 23:19.189
I couldn't have done it alone.

23:21.817 --> 23:26.530
You're quite a persistent woman,
aren't you, Tamayo?

23:26.613 --> 23:29.157
What an unreasonable grudge.

23:30.200 --> 23:33.495
Who killed your husband and your child?

23:34.162 --> 23:37.082
Was it me? No.

23:37.165 --> 23:39.751
It was none other than you.

23:39.835 --> 23:41.670
You killed and ate them.

23:43.672 --> 23:49.136
Had I known that,
I would never have become a demon.

23:50.387 --> 23:53.390
I said I didn't want to die
from my illness.

23:53.473 --> 23:57.060
It's because I wanted to see
my child grow up!

23:57.894 --> 24:01.731
After that, you continued
to kill many humans.

24:01.815 --> 24:04.943
Was that just my imagination?

24:05.026 --> 24:09.906
You looked like you were
enjoying eating them.

24:09.990 --> 24:11.199
Yes, I did!

24:11.283 --> 24:14.119
I killed many in my desperation!

24:15.203 --> 24:21.042
And to atone for those sins,
I will die here with you!

24:21.877 --> 24:24.379
Himejima! Now it's your turn!

24:38.393 --> 24:43.148
Namu Amida Butsu!

24:56.119 --> 24:57.913
The first time I met him,

24:58.580 --> 25:02.667
the Master was 14 and I was 18.

25:03.710 --> 25:10.342
From his demeanor, it was hard to believe
that he was four years younger than me.

25:12.844 --> 25:18.016
I know that you fought to protect others.

25:19.893 --> 25:21.728
You are not a murderer.

25:28.401 --> 25:35.075
He always offered exactly the words
people yearned to hear in that moment.

25:38.370 --> 25:44.918
His solemnity never wavered
from the time we met until his death.

25:48.004 --> 25:52.884
Within five days, Muzan will come.

25:55.303 --> 25:58.265
Use me as bait

25:59.516 --> 26:03.770
and take Muzan's head for me.

26:06.106 --> 26:09.484
Why do you think he will come?

26:11.861 --> 26:16.032
It is just intuition. No reason.

26:18.034 --> 26:20.328
In addition to that distinctive voice,

26:20.412 --> 26:25.208
the Ubuyashiki family had
an extraordinary sense of intuition.

26:27.002 --> 26:31.464
Some called it foresight,
the ability to see the future.

26:32.215 --> 26:37.595
This gift allowed them to amass
great wealth and avoid numerous crises.

26:40.348 --> 26:42.809
The other children

26:43.643 --> 26:47.188
would never agree

26:48.023 --> 26:49.607
to use me as bait.

26:51.526 --> 26:55.572
I can only entrust this to you, Gyomei.

26:58.783 --> 27:02.579
Understood. If that is your wish, Master.

27:07.709 --> 27:08.835
Thank you.

27:11.921 --> 27:14.799
I just hope that no more

27:15.800 --> 27:22.599
of my precious children have to die.

27:28.813 --> 27:32.275
Just as the Master predicted.

27:32.359 --> 27:34.361
This Muzan, this man…

27:35.612 --> 27:38.198
He doesn't die
even if you cut off his head!

27:39.532 --> 27:46.206
I suppose the only thing
that can destroy Muzan is sunlight.

27:47.791 --> 27:52.837
If cutting off his head does not kill him,

27:52.921 --> 27:57.258
your fight will be
a battle of endurance until sunrise.

28:00.095 --> 28:03.390
Moreover, the speed
of his body's regeneration is fast.

28:03.473 --> 28:07.769
Judging by the sound, it far surpasses
any demon I have faced before.

28:10.188 --> 28:14.984
Even after he was blasted by Master
and weakened by our collaborator,

28:15.902 --> 28:18.655
he still retains this much strength.

28:19.656 --> 28:22.075
We must keep this monster restrained

28:22.158 --> 28:25.412
in a place where the sunlight
can reach him until dawn.

28:28.248 --> 28:30.166
Black Blood Brambles!

28:32.669 --> 28:37.841
Stone Breathing, Third Form: Stone Skin!

28:53.106 --> 28:55.775
Was it you?

28:55.859 --> 29:02.782
What did you do to the Master?

29:08.621 --> 29:09.873
Master!

29:10.915 --> 29:12.083
Master!

29:27.182 --> 29:29.267
The Hashiras have assembled.

29:29.350 --> 29:32.353
The Master's strategy is brilliant!

29:44.449 --> 29:46.785
It is Muzan!

29:46.868 --> 29:49.120
Muzan Kibutsuji is here!

29:49.204 --> 29:51.748
He won't die even if you cut off his head!

29:53.500 --> 29:54.876
He's…

29:54.959 --> 29:56.085
So that's…

29:56.169 --> 29:57.629
That man is…

29:58.379 --> 29:59.464
That bastard.

29:59.547 --> 30:00.632
It's Kibutsuji.

30:01.758 --> 30:03.384
Muzan!

30:03.468 --> 30:06.012
Mist Breathing, Fourth Form!

30:06.095 --> 30:08.223
Insect Breathing, Butterfly Dance!

30:08.306 --> 30:10.767
Serpent Breathing, First Form!

30:10.850 --> 30:13.144
Love Breathing, Fifth Form!

30:13.228 --> 30:15.772
Water Breathing, Third Form!

30:15.897 --> 30:18.399
Wind Breathing, Seventh Form!

30:18.483 --> 30:20.693
Hinokami Kagura:

30:22.070 --> 30:23.863
Sunflower Thrust!

31:37.228 --> 31:39.689
What the heck is happening?

31:41.482 --> 31:43.234
Hold on tight!

32:32.867 --> 32:34.410
Tanjiro!

32:45.254 --> 32:48.633
Do you think you've got me cornered?

32:48.716 --> 32:52.345
You are all now going to Hell!

32:52.470 --> 32:54.889
You demon hunters are an eyesore!

32:55.640 --> 32:59.143
Tonight, I'm going to slaughter
every last one of you!

33:03.189 --> 33:05.858
You're the one who's going to Hell, Muzan!

33:05.942 --> 33:07.819
I won't let you escape!

33:08.903 --> 33:15.493
Do it if you can, Tanjiro Kamado!

33:17.787 --> 33:19.956
I'll defeat you for sure!

33:20.039 --> 33:22.750
Muzan Kibutsuji!

34:28.232 --> 34:31.778
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

34:31.861 --> 34:35.239
It's time to show you the answer

34:35.323 --> 34:41.579
Beyond the endless spiral

34:57.261 --> 35:00.848
The reason why it sounded like an excuse

35:00.932 --> 35:04.393
A weakness that draws in a fleeting future

35:04.477 --> 35:10.108
You mistake it for strength

35:10.858 --> 35:12.693
So detestable, so detestable

35:12.777 --> 35:14.570
So disgraceful, so disgraceful

35:14.654 --> 35:17.990
The heart that is so bleak

35:18.074 --> 35:19.700
So dark, so dark

35:19.784 --> 35:21.536
That it almost hides the moon

35:21.619 --> 35:25.331
If only you weren't here

35:25.414 --> 35:28.918
It sways and sways

35:29.001 --> 35:32.505
Carrying on its intentions
Just like a flower

35:32.588 --> 35:36.008
Taking it all away, taking it all away

35:36.092 --> 35:39.345
It tears the heart just like a storm would

35:39.428 --> 35:42.932
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

35:43.015 --> 35:46.435
It's time to show you the answer

35:46.519 --> 35:51.899
Beyond the endless spiral

35:51.983 --> 35:56.070
Who awaits there

35:57.822 --> 36:01.450
I swallowed the fate
That has befallen upon me

36:01.534 --> 36:04.871
I memorized all the names that I carry on

36:04.954 --> 36:10.543
With these burning feelings
Strong enough to inflame the heart

36:11.294 --> 36:13.087
So detestable, so detestable

36:13.171 --> 36:14.964
So disgraceful, so disgraceful

36:15.047 --> 36:18.342
To the point it divides the world

36:18.426 --> 36:20.219
Rage, rage

36:20.303 --> 36:22.013
A burning heart

36:22.096 --> 36:25.766
If only you weren't here

36:25.850 --> 36:29.353
It sways and sways

36:29.437 --> 36:32.899
Carrying on its intentions
Just like a flower

36:32.982 --> 36:36.444
Taking it all away, taking it all away

36:36.527 --> 36:39.780
It tears the heart just like a storm would

36:39.864 --> 36:43.409
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

36:43.492 --> 36:46.871
It's time to show you the answer

36:46.954 --> 36:53.044
Beyond the endless spiral

36:54.212 --> 36:57.798
The result of lending an ear
To a wailing ghost

36:57.882 --> 37:01.344
All things reside within me
Leading to my end

37:01.427 --> 37:08.351
The weak one who entrusts
The infinity to others

37:08.434 --> 37:12.104
The glow of life is timeless

37:12.188 --> 37:15.566
The blinks of prayers in the setting sun

37:15.650 --> 37:19.111
A thousand nights harbored within yourself

37:19.195 --> 37:23.241
These thoughts are imposed

37:24.408 --> 37:27.912
It withers and withers

37:27.995 --> 37:31.540
It tears a flower in the infinite night

37:31.624 --> 37:35.086
It carries on, it carries on

37:35.169 --> 37:38.714
It plants seeds in the storm

37:38.798 --> 37:42.260
It sways and sways

37:42.343 --> 37:45.805
Carrying on its intentions
Just like a flower

37:45.888 --> 37:49.392
Taking it all away, taking it all away

37:49.475 --> 37:52.687
It tears the heart just like a storm would

37:52.770 --> 37:56.274
To you who is ignorant of
What eternity means

37:56.357 --> 37:59.652
It's time to show you the answer

37:59.735 --> 38:05.241
Beyond the endless spiral

38:05.324 --> 38:11.706
Who awaits there

38:35.313 --> 38:38.941
DEMON SLAYER: HASHIRA TRAINING ARC
THE END

38:39.025 --> 38:40.401
DEMON SLAYER: KIMETSU NO YAIBA:
HASHIRA TRAINING ARC NO. 8

38:41.068 --> 38:43.738
This time I'll tell you about Kanroji.

38:43.821 --> 38:47.116
What's this? Telling them about me?

38:47.199 --> 38:49.744
Kanroji is very attractive.

38:51.537 --> 38:53.331
She is a pretty lady.

38:54.832 --> 38:58.419
But I believe you already know that.

38:58.502 --> 39:01.547
That's why we're doing
Taisho period secret.

39:01.630 --> 39:05.092
Kanroji was Rengoku's Tsuguko.

39:05.176 --> 39:08.387
His training was so harsh
that everyone ran away.

39:08.471 --> 39:11.307
But Kanroji didn't give up.

39:12.224 --> 39:18.773
Even though his training was harsh,
he was serious and full of passion.

39:18.856 --> 39:20.358
I can imagine that.

39:21.150 --> 39:25.696
If we're going to introduce every Hashira,
we should include Rengoku as well.

39:25.780 --> 39:27.073
You're right!

39:27.907 --> 39:30.284
Taisho period secret, again.

39:30.368 --> 39:32.912
Rengoku was a cool big brother.

39:32.995 --> 39:37.708
He trained and taught me a lot of things,
he also pampered me.

39:37.792 --> 39:41.337
Besides, he used to eat a lot!

39:41.420 --> 39:47.218
You know, the two of us ate
a big pot of sweet potato rice!

39:47.301 --> 39:48.469
Wasshoi!

39:48.552 --> 39:50.221
Wasshoi!

39:50.304 --> 39:52.515
It's a really wonderful memory.

39:52.598 --> 39:56.435
Wow! I wish I could have had
sweet potato rice with him.

39:57.895 --> 40:00.356
That's nostalgic. I remember it too.

40:05.820 --> 40:08.614
Finally, the time to fight
Muzan Kibutsuji has come.

40:09.407 --> 40:10.741
I'm counting on you guys.

40:14.203 --> 40:17.498
Just now, Rengoku was there, right?

40:17.581 --> 40:18.874
Yes.

40:18.958 --> 40:21.043
It's not a dream, right?

40:21.127 --> 40:22.378
Surely not.

40:23.546 --> 40:24.630
Tanjiro!

40:24.713 --> 40:25.714
Yes!

40:25.798 --> 40:28.384
We must defeat Kibutsuji!

40:28.467 --> 40:30.052
Yes, we will!

40:31.053 --> 40:32.304
Definitely!
